    {
      "example": "r-bp1zxszhcgatnx****-db-0",
      "help_en": "The ID of the data node for which you want to query available resources that can be created. You can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/473786.html operation to query the ID of the data node. Remove the number sign (`#`) and the content that follows the number sign. For example, retain only r-bp10noxlhcoim2\\\\-db-0.\n\nBefore you specify this parameter, you must set the InstanceId parameter to the ID of an instance that uses the cluster or read/write splitting architecture",
      "help_zh": "数据节点ID，可调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/473786.html获取。对于获取到的数据节点ID，需要去除井号（0）及其后面的内容，例如仅保留r-bp10noxlhcoim2****-db-0。\n传入本参数前，您还需要传入InstanceId参数，且要求实例为集群或读写分离架构",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "node_id",
      "options": [
        "--node-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "NodeId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "professional",
      "help_en": "The edition of the instance. Valid values:\n\nprofessional: Standard Edition. This edition supports the standalone, master-replica, read /write splitting, and cluster architectures and provides high scalability",
      "help_zh": "产品系列，取值如下：\nprofessional：标准版，支持单副本、主备、读写分离、集群四种架构，扩展性强。\n <props=\"china\">\neconomical：仅支持主备架构，具有价格优势，更多信息请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2489678.html。</props>",
